# Review Subagents: No Unit Tests

When launching thermos, thermo-nuclear, Bugbot, security-review, or similar
review subagents:

- Do **not** instruct them to run unit tests, package suites, `go test`,
  `make test`, or equivalent verification commands.
- Explicitly tell each subagent to review via diff and source reading only.
- The caller already ensures tests pass; subagent test runs waste time and
  obscure review signal.
